  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Samwiri n'addira eccupa ey'amafuta n'agifuka ku mutwe gwa Sawulo, n'amunywegera ng'agamba nti, \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akufuseeko amafuta okufuga abantu be, Isirayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'onoova wano leero, onoosisinkana abasajja babiri okumpi n'amalaalo ga Laakeeri, e Zereza ku nsalo ya Benyamini, banaakugamba nti, 'Endogoyi ze wagenda okunoonya zaalabise. Kitaawo kaakano takyalowooza ku ndogoyi, naye, yeeraliikirira ggwe, nga yeebuuza nti, \"Ebya mutabani wange mbikole ntya?\" '",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bw'onoova awo, ne weeyongerayo okutuuka ku mwera gwa Taboli, onoosisinkana abasajja basatu abanaaba bagenda okusisinkana Katonda e Beseri, omu nga yeetisse obubuzi busatu, omulala nga yeetisse emigaati esatu, n'omulala ng'asitudde eccupa y'envinnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banaakulamusa ne bakuwa emigaati ebiri, era gikkirize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Bw'onoova eyo ogenda ku Lusozi lwa Katonda oluliko ekigo eky'Abafirisuuti. Bw'onooba onootera okutuuka ku kibuga, onoosisinkana ekibiina kya bannabbi nga baserengeta okuva mu kifo ekigulumivu nga bakulembeddwamu abakuba entongooli, n'ebitaasa, n'endere, n'ennanga, era nga bawa obunnabbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwoyo wa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anakukkako mu maanyi, n'owa obunnabbi wamu nabo, era onookyusibwa n'ofuuka omuntu omuggya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obubonero obwo bwe bunaatuukirira, kola kyonna ky'onoolaba nga kituufu, kubanga Katonda ali wamu naawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Serengeta onsookeyo e Girugaali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Nnaakugoberera ne nzija gy'oli okuwaayo ssaddaaka ez'ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa n'ebiweebwayo olw'emirembe, naye oteekwa okunnindako okumala ennaku musanvu okutuusa lwe ndijja gy'oli ne nkutegeeza eky'okukola.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawulo Afuulibwa Kabaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Sawulo bwe yava eri Samwiri, Katonda n'amuwa omutima omuggya, n'obubonero obwo bwonna ne butuukirira ku lunaku olwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baatuuka ku lusozi ekibiina kya bannabbi ne kimusisinkana, Omwoyo wa Katonda n'amukkako mu maanyi era n'atandika okuwa obunnabbi wamu nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaali baamumanya okuva edda n'edda bwe baamulaba ng'awa obunnabbi wamu ne bannabbi, ne bagambagana nti, \"Kiki kino ekituuse ku mutabani wa Kiisi? Sawulo naye ali omu ku bannabbi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu ku batuuze b'ekitundu ekyo n'abuuza nti, \"Ye kitaabwe y'ani?\" Kyerwava lufuuka olugero nti, \"Ne Sawulo ali omu ku bannabbi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Sawulo bwe yamala okuwa obunnabbi, n'ayambuka mu kifo ekigulumivu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo kojja wa Sawulo n'ababuuza ye n'omuweereza nti, \"Mubadde wa?\" N'addamu nti, \"Tubadde tunoonya endogoyi, naye bwe tutaazirabye, ne tugenda eri Samwiri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kojja wa Sawulo n'amugamba nti, \"Mbuulira Samwiri kye yakugambye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulo n'addamu nti, \"Yatutegeeza nti endogoyi zaali zirabise.\" Naye n'atamubuulira Samwiri bye yamugamba ku by'obwakabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samwiri n'ayita abantu ba Isirayiri bakuŋŋaanire eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e Mizupa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abagamba nti, \"Bw'ati bw'ayogera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Katonda wa Isirayiri nti, 'Naggya Isirayiri mu Misiri, ne mbalokola okuva mu mukono gw'Abamisiri, ne mu mukono gw'obwakabaka bwonna obwabajooganga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye kaakano mujeemedde Katonda wammwe eyabalokola okuva mu buyinike bwammwe n'ennaku yammwe, ne mwogera nti, Nedda, tuteerewo kabaka atufuge.' Kale mweyanjule mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu bika byammwe ne nnyiriri zammwe nga bwe biri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Samwiri bwe yasembeza ebika byonna ebya Isirayiri okumpi ne we yali, ekika kya Benyamini ne kirondebwa na kalulu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'asembeza ekika kya Benyamini, lunyiriri ku lunyiriri, era olunyiriri lwa Materi ne lulondebwa. N'oluvannyuma Sawulo mutabani wa Kiisi n'alondebwa, naye bwe baamunoonya, nga talabika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne beeyongera okwebuuza ku",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nti, \"Omusajja w'ali wano, atuuse?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 10:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'abaddamu nti, \"Ye, yeekwese mu bitereke.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne badduka ne bagenda ne bamuleeta. Bwe yayimirira mu bantu, n'aba ng'asinga abantu bonna obuwanvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samwiri n'agamba abantu bonna nti, \"Mulaba omusajja",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gw'alonze? Tewali amwenkana mu bantu bonna.\" Abantu ne baddamu n'eddoboozi eddene nti, \"Wangaala Kabaka.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samwiri n'annyonnyola abantu ebiragiro n'obulombolombo eby'obwakabaka, n'abiwandiika mu kitabo n'akiteeka mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.10.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Awo Samwiri n'asiibula abantu bonna, buli omu n'addayo ewuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sawulo naye n'addayo ewaabwe mu Gibea, ng'awerekerwako abasajja abazira Katonda be yali akomyeko ku mitima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abamu ku basajja ab'effujjo ne boogera nti, \"Omusajja ono ayinza atya okutulokola?\" Ne bamunyooma, era ne batamuwa na birabo. Naye Sawulo n'akisirikira n'atabanyega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
